  "description": "Derived biodiversity raster products for birds, vascular plants and insects from the Hotspot project, NTNU Gjærevollsenteret. Modelled with integrated species distribution models (INLA/inlabru) from GBIF occurrence data. Uncertainty is reported on a scale relative to each taxon individually: a high-uncertainty area for birds (a well-recorded taxon) may be substantially less uncertain in absolute terms than a similarly-scored area for insects (a sparsely-recorded taxon).",
